WEBVTT

00:10:27.373 --> 00:10:34.296
(Applause)

00:10:36.006 --> 00:10:38.801
That is how fast things can move.

00:10:39.510 --> 00:10:42.012
And that's what anyone, not just me,

00:10:42.012 --> 00:10:48.435
but anyone can accomplish when you accept
the uncertainty of what might be,

00:10:48.435 --> 00:10:51.730
and through careful contingency planning,

00:10:51.772 --> 00:10:54.233
turn it into the certainty
of what will be.

00:10:55.567 --> 00:10:57.986
You will find yourself somewhere new.

00:10:58.487 --> 00:10:59.822
And different.